        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_26",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Having risen to the rank of aspirant, Gorlack only needed perform an act of duty to secure his entry into the contention."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_27",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("The opportunity arose with a summons from Dominant Vladnir..."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_28",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ The treachery of Gorath Ohm was only a brush with the coming war between flights. Many eyes watch us that will soon be of rogues. They spy frailty... For even now an infestation of voracious landbound creatures keeps a holdfast on our northernmost isle. This isle that was before bountiful with game is now laid bare by these infesters."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_29",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/fighter.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ So then let this pestilence be harvested in place of the meat it has taken!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_30",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Aspirant Karron, offer your ploy of attack."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_31",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/fighter.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Full encirclement from offshore. No escape will be permitted. From the circle I shall spy their thinnest line of defense. Then strike through it to reach the nighest watchtower. From there I rally a force to purge the isle. Wherever their defenses thin to feed a counter attack against me, the circle will fall upon."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_32",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ A firm ploy, Aspirant Karron. Now offer yours, Aspirant Gorlack."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_33",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Cornered prey defends its back. Encircling is folly. Let our prey think they can thwart us. Two equal wings of drakes. First wing strikes southeast watchtower on first dawn. The creatures will rally to fall upon it, a mere half force as it is. On second dawn, second wing strikes opposite from northwest. Where they will find our prey’s back turned to them."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_34",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/fighter.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Your first wing would not last the day, Gorlack. It is you who speaks folly!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_35",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ The wing will hold. I shall lead it myself to see that it does."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_36",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Aspirant Gorlack, for the first time your ploy is bolder than Aspirant Karron’s. I am curious as to why."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_37",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ So that I may capture the leader of our prey unspoilt. Urged by the touch of flame, this creature might breathe secrets for reaching far lands beyond the sea."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_38",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/fighter.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Again you waste time pondering Resha’s glider myths! If the far lands of glider legend ever were, they now dwell below the waves. Every raindrop drowns more of the world till the sky itself is filled."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_39",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/inferno.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ Wingless. Finless. These intruders are land bound. They can only be from distant land."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_40",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: _("portraits/drakes/warden.webp"),
            text: _("<span color='#bcb088'><b></b></span> _ So it will be. Aspirant Gorlack, you may take this captive for inquisition. Aspirant Karron, you have lead of the second wing. The Hunt is Called."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "loyal_41",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            units: "Gorlack,Resha,Viragar,Grol,Pigor,Grag,u_14,Koli",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "objectives",
        side: 1,
        victory: _("Capture Viragar by surrounding him with drakes on all six sides (best do so before Karron’s wing gets to him) Destroy any remaining orcish ships Destroy any remaining orcish ships"),
        defeat: _("Death of Viragar Death of Gorlack Death of Resha Death of Gorlack Death of Resha"),
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
