        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("It seems by our swift approach we have evaded our foe’s notice. They have yet to rally a defense."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("We shall retake the nigh watchtower before they do so. From there we rally a defense of our own."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Resha",
            text: _("If we are to ensnare their leader unharmed, then we must surround it with our hunters."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Make that your first task, Resha. Once we have our captive, burn their sea skimmers. The landbound prey may then be left for our younger hunters to harvest."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_9",
        on: "attack_end",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            unit: "Grag",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Grag",
            text: _("These vomiting wyrms again!? I HATE THEM!!!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "turn_refresh",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_side",
            equals: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Viragar",
            text: _("Rally! Rally! Get to your posts, you scum! Wyrms are raining down on us! Pull our boats back and keep the fire breathers off them!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22Outrigger%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "have_unit",
                id: "Viragar",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Viragar",
            text: _("I told you to keep my boats away from those wyrms, you useless SCUM! Wyrms breathe fire... boats are wood... fire is BAD for wood."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Oh, fire breathing ‘wyrms’ ... thought you meant protect the boats from woodworms. That makes more sense; never heard of fire breathing woodworms."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Viragar",
            text: _("They are committed now, SO just ATTACK! Harry them with everything you got, dung maggot!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_12",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%2222%22%2C%22y%22%3A%2224%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "u_10",
            type: "Drake Clasher",
            side: 1,
            x: 20,
            y: 23,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "u_10",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("Clasher, fall in."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("My duty is to first destroy the Secrets of our library. The Secrets my caste keeps must not be seen by a foe."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gorlack",
            text: _("There is no foe on this isle, only prey. The hunt has been called. Your prior duty is hereby superseded."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_13",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 22,
            y: 24,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22event%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22moveto%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22This%20firescale%20is%20far%20too%20cumbersome%20for%20armor%20making...%5Cn%5CnClasher%20glyphs%20are%20engraved%20into%20it%3B%20this%20firescale%20must%20bear%20Secrets%20of%20their%20caste.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("This firescale is far too cumbersome for armor making... Clasher glyphs are engraved into it; this firescale must bear Secrets of their caste."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 22,
            y: 24,
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22event%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22moveto%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22It%20is%20forbidden%20for%20me%20to%20speak%20the%20Secrets%20engraved%20into%20this%20firescale.%5Cn%5CnBy%20the%20Ways%20of%20Morogor%2C%20we%20clashers%20must%20keep%20our%20Secrets.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("It is forbidden for me to speak the Secrets engraved into this firescale. By the Ways of Morogor, we clashers must keep our Secrets."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "moveto",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 12,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("...that a fearsome war between drakes is fast approaching. Each flight is led by a ‘dominant’ and advised by three ranked intendants. Beneath these are aspirants, whose position is like a princeship except their ascension to dominant is decided by contest. There is also a caste system that cuts across the flights, with four castes— — Burners are strategic thinkers and show special concern for their fellow drakes. They are natural leaders. But prideful and prone to losing sight of the little things that grow into defeat. — Clashers are trusted by all to fairly enforce the Ways of Morogor. They guard the drake hatcheries, and also libraries of secret knowledge engraved into ceramic tablets. They keep these secrets not just from us, but from the <i>other castes</i>. — Fighters are bold. Quick thinking but decisive to the point of shortsightedness. They are our biggest trouble here. — Gliders have a curious mind steeped in the ‘Spoken Memories’, a kind of oral history unknown to the other castes. As scouts, messengers, and stewards of the hunting grounds, they know Morogor is sinking. But the other castes ignore their warnings. A young glider, Resha, told me her caste hopes to escape Morogor, and I suspect our arrival here may have encouraged them. Thankfully, Jessene keeps all her navigational charts under lock and key. If she hadn’t, the beating of dragon wings might be heard over Southbay! Jessene says her people are familiar with these dragons. Their tomes describe such a race of monsters that drove the Wesfolk from the distant west. And the gliders too have stories of drakes living far beyond Morogor. Resha told me a few of these stories, before our parley was broken by another rebellion from the fighter caste. <i>― Prince Leodren of Southbay, 26th day of the Eastward Oceanic Expedition</i>"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_16",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 12,
            y: 4,
